WEBVTT

00:00:19.540 --> 00:00:20.840
Congratulations!

00:00:34.010 --> 00:00:36.140
Yurika-san looks so nice.

00:00:36.140 --> 00:00:37.800
Best wishes to the couple.

00:00:38.270 --> 00:00:39.310
Thank you.

00:00:40.140 --> 00:00:42.020
Yurika-san, congratulations.

00:00:42.020 --> 00:00:45.810
Haru, you looked like this earlier, you lucky guy!

00:00:50.150 --> 00:00:51.700
You too.

00:00:54.660 --> 00:00:57.240
It’s my and Ryo-sama’s turn next.

00:00:57.240 --> 00:00:59.750
Thank you, everyone!

00:01:09.710 --> 00:01:14.970
So I don’t spill my wish from my eyes,

00:01:15.760 --> 00:01:21.790
I want to make my heart race to you.

00:01:23.140 --> 00:01:29.150
I put my feelings on this palette of endearment

00:01:29.150 --> 00:01:34.780
and paint them on my heart.

00:01:35.740 --> 00:01:37.740
The sweetness

00:01:38.870 --> 00:01:42.830
and the strength you gave are sitting back to back.

00:01:42.830 --> 00:01:44.290
The time

00:01:46.000 --> 00:01:50.710
is drawing bells in the sky.

00:01:52.270 --> 00:01:58.850
Colorful assortments of balloons of dreams

00:01:58.850 --> 00:02:00.690
float in the wind,

00:02:00.690 --> 00:02:02.570
flowing toward you,

00:02:02.570 --> 00:02:06.040
and become the boat to our future.

00:02:06.040 --> 00:02:12.850
I’m happy that I found destiny.

00:02:12.850 --> 00:02:16.530
It’s filling with colors.

00:02:16.530 --> 00:02:21.530
The Wedding of Love and Glory
A Great Conflict!!

00:02:23.450 --> 00:02:27.470
Yurika-san was really pretty, wasn’t she?

00:02:28.080 --> 00:02:30.880
Haru has done his thing too,

00:02:30.880 --> 00:02:33.920
and is now in the middle of the honeymoon, huh?

00:02:34.420 --> 00:02:39.600
I want to wear such a nice wedding dress someday, too.

00:02:40.470 --> 00:02:43.550
Idiot, why are you talking about something so far in the future?

00:02:43.550 --> 00:02:45.810
By the way, was that today?

00:02:45.810 --> 00:02:46.430
I mean…

00:03:02.440 --> 00:03:04.080
Moving?

00:03:04.080 --> 00:03:07.710
I guess someone is moving into Haru’s old place today.

00:03:08.220 --> 00:03:11.960
All right, let’s go say hello and check out who’s moving in.

00:03:24.350 --> 00:03:25.140
SMILE.

00:03:25.140 --> 00:03:26.020
“Smile”…?

00:03:27.640 --> 00:03:29.940
What’s the matter, Brother?

00:03:29.940 --> 00:03:30.860
Don’t come close!

00:03:30.860 --> 00:03:32.770
You don’t have to see this!

00:03:33.270 --> 00:03:34.780
You’re acting strange…

00:03:34.780 --> 00:03:36.600
Well, I’m just…

00:03:38.490 --> 00:03:40.070
Are you all right, Akane?

00:03:40.070 --> 00:03:42.460
I’m fine, but is this…

00:03:44.750 --> 00:03:50.040
I, Masuda Shizuka, will be your next door neighbor starting today.

00:03:50.040 --> 00:03:53.210
As incompetent as I am,
do not think poorly of me.

00:03:53.680 --> 00:03:54.800
Shizuka-chan!

00:03:55.380 --> 00:03:56.720
Why you…

00:03:57.470 --> 00:04:01.100
I missed you so much,
so I ran away from home.

00:04:02.600 --> 00:04:04.530
Welcome back, Shizuka-chan!

00:04:04.530 --> 00:04:07.440
Play with me again, Akane-san!

00:04:07.440 --> 00:04:09.140
It’s not time to play around!

00:04:09.140 --> 00:04:12.690
If your dad finds out about this,
he’ll come get us again!

00:04:12.690 --> 00:04:15.360
That’s nothing to worry about.

00:04:15.360 --> 00:04:18.150
My grandfather’s condition was not serious.

00:04:18.150 --> 00:04:20.150
Was not serious?

00:04:20.150 --> 00:04:24.450
I conspired with him to shut my father up.

00:04:32.920 --> 00:04:35.510
MASU CO. SOUTH POLE BRANCH
What the hell is this?!

00:04:35.510 --> 00:04:36.000
MASU CO. SOUTH POLE BRANCH

00:04:41.130 --> 00:04:43.090
I see…

00:04:43.950 --> 00:04:49.920
But that stubborn old man did not give in after our coup d’etat,

00:04:49.920 --> 00:04:52.020
and still would not allow me to room with Ryo-sama.

00:04:52.020 --> 00:04:54.490
This is the same as rooming together!

00:04:54.490 --> 00:04:55.310
Oh?

00:04:55.310 --> 00:04:57.730
I just made it a bit more convenient.

00:04:57.730 --> 00:04:59.990
I’ll put a door in, too.

00:05:01.200 --> 00:05:03.990
I’ll guarantee privacy for you two.

00:05:04.410 --> 00:05:05.780
Privacy?

00:05:05.780 --> 00:05:06.660
Still…

00:05:06.660 --> 00:05:09.040
Well, well… don’t mind the details.

00:05:09.040 --> 00:05:12.670
Treat me just like before, Ryo-sama!

00:05:12.670 --> 00:05:14.000
I refuse!

00:05:15.340 --> 00:05:20.500
Just like before, I am going to live strongly, yet conservatively, with Akane!

00:05:20.500 --> 00:05:23.110
That’s so cold, Ryo-sama!

00:05:23.110 --> 00:05:25.260
Hey, Ryo, Kane-chan.

00:05:25.930 --> 00:05:27.390
It’s about time to go.

00:05:27.390 --> 00:05:28.760
Are you ready?

00:05:30.180 --> 00:05:33.190
Oh, wow!

00:05:34.980 --> 00:05:40.330
It’s exciting to be able to see the brand new, talk-of-the-town spot before it opens.

00:05:42.320 --> 00:05:44.780
Hey, the TV station is over there!

00:05:45.460 --> 00:05:46.620
But, Ojo,

00:05:46.620 --> 00:05:49.950
how did members of the general public like us get invited to the pre-opening event?

00:05:49.950 --> 00:05:52.740
Oh, about that…

00:05:54.620 --> 00:05:58.700
My brother is the chief development officer of this place.

00:05:58.700 --> 00:06:02.260
He said he wanted to ask you and me to work here on something.

00:06:02.870 --> 00:06:04.740
Your brother did?

00:06:04.740 --> 00:06:05.980
That’s right.

00:06:06.640 --> 00:06:09.090
As the models for a commercial for the wedding hall.

00:06:09.500 --> 00:06:11.050
The models for a commercial…

00:06:11.050 --> 00:06:13.100
for the wedding hall?

00:06:13.100 --> 00:06:14.600
Ojo and I?

00:06:14.600 --> 00:06:15.850
Yes.

00:06:15.850 --> 00:06:18.070
The catch phrase is none other than…

00:06:18.900 --> 00:06:20.870
“Steal the love.”

00:06:25.860 --> 00:06:27.610
Andy!

00:06:27.610 --> 00:06:28.780
Catherine!

00:06:32.580 --> 00:06:33.560
See?

00:06:33.560 --> 00:06:37.290
There are no other appropriate people to play these roles.

00:06:37.790 --> 00:06:42.380
I’m confident that Emiho will be the most beautiful bride in the country.

00:06:42.380 --> 00:06:43.210
This is it.

00:06:43.210 --> 00:06:45.680
This commercial is going to be a hit!

00:06:49.750 --> 00:06:51.390
Naohiro-sama,

00:06:51.390 --> 00:06:54.980
I see that your adorance for your sister has not changed at all.

00:06:54.980 --> 00:06:57.770
Don’t you mean adoration…?

00:06:57.770 --> 00:07:00.360
I admit that Emiho-sama is pretty.

00:07:00.360 --> 00:07:04.270
But there is only one person who is permitted to stand beside Ryo-sama in a wedding dress.

00:07:04.860 --> 00:07:05.950
Steal the love!

00:07:05.950 --> 00:07:09.960
I shall steal that role!

00:07:10.780 --> 00:07:11.580
What?!

00:07:11.580 --> 00:07:13.460
Wait a minute!

00:07:13.460 --> 00:07:16.330
If this is going to be on TV, I’ll do it too!

00:07:16.830 --> 00:07:19.420
It’s not like I wanted it originally,

00:07:19.420 --> 00:07:24.090
but I’m not that nice, to just give up
anything that anyone asks for.

00:07:24.590 --> 00:07:28.010
Maybe I want to wear it too…

00:07:28.010 --> 00:07:29.470
Akane! You too?!

00:07:30.050 --> 00:07:33.310
What we have are four gorgeous beauties.

00:07:33.310 --> 00:07:36.510
We should hold a Pick-The-Bride contest!

00:07:36.510 --> 00:07:38.480
Pick-The-Bride Contest!!

00:07:38.940 --> 00:07:40.230
How dare you…

00:07:40.230 --> 00:07:43.740
For such a contest,
it needs to start with…

00:07:44.360 --> 00:07:47.750
the swimsuit contest!

00:07:54.120 --> 00:07:56.340
Bravo!

00:07:56.740 --> 00:07:57.870
What the…!?

00:08:03.750 --> 00:08:05.760
Even Akane?!

00:08:07.880 --> 00:08:10.800
Following that, to show the basics of holding a family unit close…

00:08:10.800 --> 00:08:12.520
a cooking contest!

00:08:16.850 --> 00:08:19.260
I won’t lose!

00:08:24.190 --> 00:08:26.230
Everyone’s is good, except for contestant number 3, Miki.

00:08:26.230 --> 00:08:29.780
Oh, number 4, Akane’s, is wonderful!

00:08:29.780 --> 00:08:31.660
Number 1, Shizuka’s, is perfect!

00:08:32.240 --> 00:08:33.950
Of course!

00:08:33.950 --> 00:08:35.160
Darn.

00:08:35.740 --> 00:08:36.950
Men must be courageous.

00:08:36.950 --> 00:08:38.320
Women must be lovely.

00:08:38.320 --> 00:08:40.290
The cuteness appeal test!

00:08:40.790 --> 00:08:42.290
Damn, Shizuka!

00:08:42.290 --> 00:08:44.420
Ojo is clearly disadvantaged this time!

00:08:45.050 --> 00:08:46.090
Excuse me!

00:08:46.090 --> 00:08:48.360
If I need to be…

00:08:49.170 --> 00:08:53.510
I’ll try my best to become the bride of your dreams.

00:08:53.510 --> 00:08:55.930
Cheer for me, everyone.

00:08:55.930 --> 00:08:57.930
Yeah! Yeah!

00:08:58.980 --> 00:09:00.310
That was so good!

00:09:01.980 --> 00:09:05.270
Showing vitality by surviving household chores…

00:09:05.270 --> 00:09:06.610
will be skipped.

00:09:06.610 --> 00:09:08.310
To shut up the lovers,

00:09:08.310 --> 00:09:10.400
the sweet voice attack!

00:09:11.000 --> 00:09:12.990
Please.

00:09:12.990 --> 00:09:15.910
Don’t be so mean, Daddy.

00:09:17.580 --> 00:09:20.180
And, to conclude the event, here we go!

00:09:20.180 --> 00:09:22.410
The ultimate love making contest!

00:09:24.960 --> 00:09:27.330
Yeah!

00:09:27.330 --> 00:09:28.460
Idiot!

00:09:28.460 --> 00:09:30.380
Now they can’t air this anymore!

00:09:30.380 --> 00:09:32.260
Oh, Ryo-sama!

00:09:32.260 --> 00:09:33.900
You’re too rough from the beginning!

00:09:33.900 --> 00:09:35.250
We’re in a public place!

00:09:35.250 --> 00:09:36.490
Stop it!

00:09:38.510 --> 00:09:41.180
Shizuka-chan, you’ve gone too far.

00:09:41.180 --> 00:09:43.390
Can we have a contest
in the area I’m good at?

00:09:43.390 --> 00:09:45.210
I’m confident in singing.

00:09:53.360 --> 00:09:54.370
This is it!

00:09:54.370 --> 00:09:56.410
This will do it!

00:09:56.410 --> 00:09:57.650
Oh, yes!

00:10:02.330 --> 00:10:03.660
It’s time to go.

00:10:03.660 --> 00:10:04.620
Ready…

00:10:04.620 --> 00:10:05.170
Action!

00:10:39.280 --> 00:10:40.420
This is it!

00:10:40.420 --> 00:10:43.910
The new catch phrase has been decided - “Hog the love!”

00:10:43.910 --> 00:10:46.310
Don’t decide on your own!

00:10:46.310 --> 00:10:49.750
Ryo-sama, I’m so happy!

00:10:49.750 --> 00:10:53.840
Don’t blame me if you get stabbed by my fans in the future.

00:10:54.920 --> 00:10:57.340
It feels like I’m getting married to my brother.

00:10:57.340 --> 00:10:59.060
Everyone is enjoying this.

00:10:59.060 --> 00:11:00.350
Don’t look so disappointed.

00:11:00.840 --> 00:11:04.640
Well, I guess it’s okay once in a while.

00:11:04.640 --> 00:11:07.390
Wait, is this what Haru was talking about?

00:11:09.400 --> 00:11:13.350
As such, Ryo-sama’s days of love and suffering will continue.

00:11:13.350 --> 00:11:13.980
Period.

00:11:13.980 --> 00:11:16.040
“Will continue?!”

00:11:17.250 --> 00:11:18.530
See you again!

00:11:18.530 --> 00:11:20.370
See you again Q

00:11:21.860 --> 00:11:24.900
The moment came

00:11:25.740 --> 00:11:28.900
very much out of the blue.

00:11:30.140 --> 00:11:34.040
You showed up right in front of me,

00:11:34.040 --> 00:11:36.760
then started to change everything.

00:11:37.770 --> 00:11:40.590
If my meeting you

00:11:41.490 --> 00:11:44.440
is not by fate,

00:11:45.790 --> 00:11:49.800
there are no miracles,

00:11:49.800 --> 00:11:54.990
even if I search all over the world.

00:11:55.190 --> 00:11:58.380
Embracing love,

00:11:59.190 --> 00:12:02.310
kissing love,

00:12:03.060 --> 00:12:06.240
holding love,

00:12:06.740 --> 00:12:10.540
I whisper, “I love you.”

00:12:10.540 --> 00:12:14.570
Please look at me and me alone,

00:12:14.570 --> 00:12:17.990
forever.

00:12:21.290 --> 00:12:25.400
One day, Shizuka from the
Galactic Empire suddenly appeared!

00:12:25.400 --> 00:12:27.390
Our peaceful lives on Earth are in peril!

00:12:27.390 --> 00:12:29.390
And the queen of the Galactic Empire…

00:12:29.390 --> 00:12:31.580
…looks exactly like Shizuka?!

00:12:31.580 --> 00:12:34.440
What’s up with this
messed-up plot twist?

00:12:34.440 --> 00:12:36.520
Their objective in coming to Earth is…

00:12:36.520 --> 00:12:37.740
Brother!!

00:12:38.420 --> 00:12:40.230
…to find a groom for the queen?!

00:12:41.360 --> 00:12:43.150
Why am I not surprised?

00:12:43.150 --> 00:12:44.430
Mizuhara!

00:12:44.430 --> 00:12:44.870
Ryo!

00:12:45.550 --> 00:12:49.370
If I turn her down, Japan will sink!
So I can’t resist!

00:12:49.710 --> 00:12:51.700
I won’t let anyone else have Ryo-sama!

00:12:52.160 --> 00:12:55.110
Your reply will determine not only the fate of your island nation,

00:12:55.110 --> 00:12:57.570
but also of all humanity!

00:12:57.570 --> 00:12:58.710
Think long and hard!

00:12:59.650 --> 00:13:00.900
To me…

00:13:01.610 --> 00:13:04.720
To me, Ryo-sama is more important than all of humanity!

00:13:04.720 --> 00:13:07.370
Our predictable yet lovable gag anime,

00:13:07.370 --> 00:13:10.720
now new-and-improved,
Part 2, is launching now!

00:13:10.920 --> 00:13:11.220
Wait, is this for real?

00:13:11.220 --> 00:13:12.730
No, it's not

00:13:13.610 --> 00:13:15.960
Today sure was a hectic day!

00:13:17.180 --> 00:13:21.370
This time is truly the final good-bye!

00:13:21.370 --> 00:13:22.070
Bye-bye!

00:13:22.070 --> 00:13:24.490
Bye-bye
